        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>23初级会计实务22条公式</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Heiti SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .page {\n    max-width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    position: relative;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  /* ------- top status / toolbar placeholders ------- */\n  .statusbar {\n    height: 20px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 0 10px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #555;\n  }\n  .toolbar {\n    height: 40px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e2e2;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 0 10px;\n    color: #3c7fe0;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .toolbar .group { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }\n  .toolbar .center { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #bbb;\n    color: #888;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .handle {\n    width: 30px;\n    height: 5px;\n    background: #cfcfcf;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    margin: 3px auto 0;\n  }\n  /* ------- content sheet ------- */\n  .sheet {\n    display: flex;\n    padding: 10px 0 0 0;\n  }\n  .content {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding: 0 12px 20px 14px;\n  }\n  .side-marks {\n    width: 22px;\n    padding-top: 60px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 60px;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 27px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    margin: 6px 0 16px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  h1 .red { color: #e8352c; }\n  h1 .blue { color: #4a7fe0; }\n  .heading {\n    color: #e8352c;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 14px 0 6px;\n  }\n  .line {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin: 2px 0;\n  }\n  .kw { color: #4a7fe0; font-weight: 700; }\n  .para {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    margin: 2px 0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"handle\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"statusbar\">\n    <span class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:34px;height:12px;margin-right:6px;\">[Icons]</span>\n    <span>86%</span>\n    <span class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:20px;height:11px;margin-left:4px;\">[Batt]</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"toolbar\">\n    <div class=\"group\">\n      <span>&#8249;</span>\n      <span class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;\">[&#8593;]</span>\n      <span class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;\">[&#8630;]</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"center\">\n      <span style=\"color:#111;font-weight:700;\">T</span>\n      <span class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;\">[pen]</span>\n      <span class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;\">[marker]</span>\n      <span class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;\">[erase]</span>\n      <span class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;\">[shape]</span>\n      <span class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;\">[lasso]</span>\n      <span class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;\">[hand]</span>\n      <span class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;margin-left:14px;\">[mic]</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"group\">\n      <span>+</span>\n      <span>&#8942;</span>\n      <span class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;\">[pages]</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"sheet\">\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <h1>23初级会计<span class=\"red\">实务</span><span class=\"blue\">22条公式</span></h1>\n\n      <div class=\"heading\">1. 固定资产余额. 净值. 价值公式:</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"kw\">账面余额</span>=固定资产账面原价</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"kw\">账面净值</span>=固定资产原价-累计折旧</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">账面价值=固定资产原价-固定资产减值准备-累计折旧</div>\n\n      <div class=\"heading\">2.无形资产资产余额. 净值. 价值公式:</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"kw\">账面余额</span>=无形资产账面原价</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"kw\">账面净值</span>=无形资产原价-累计摊销</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"kw\">账面价值</span>=无形资产原价-无形资产减值准备-累计摊销</div>\n\n      <div class=\"heading\">3. 存货采购成本:</div>\n      <div class=\"para\">=买价+进口关税+其他税费+运费+装卸费+保险费+其他可归属于存货达到预定可使用状态 前的合理费用(在有货采购过程中发生的仓储费、包装费、运输途中的合理损耗、入库前的挑 选整理费用)</div>\n\n      <div class=\"heading\">4. 月末一次加权平均法计算公式:</div>\n      <div class=\"para\">存货单位成本=（月初结存存货成本+$\\Sigma$(本月各批进货的实际单位成本本月各批进货的数量)） /(月初结存存货数量+本月各批进货数量之和)</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"side-marks\">\n      <div>三</div>\n      <div>三</div>\n      <div>三</div>\n      <div>三</div>\n      <div>三</div>\n      <div>三</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
